        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 3 of the Malaysian Agricultural Research and"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Development Institute Act 1969, which in this Act is referred to as \"the principal Act\" is.amended by substituting the full stop at the end of paragraph (f) with a semicolon, and by inserting, immediately after paragraph (f), the following new paragraph (g): \"(g) to conduct commercial research and production for the effective promotion and utilisation of its research findings.\"."
      }
    },
